    "summary": "A child-process helper (store-child.ts and its driver) holds a graph store and obeys commands; the reproduction test runs the breaking sequence against the real library on a temporary store and asserts each behaviour separately. Finding beyond the design: a read fails with code -30775 only in a process that never read; a process that had read (as the daemon always has, since the store module reads while opening) gets code 22 with MDB_BAD_RSLOT. Both are pinned, plus a control case. The detection of Tasks t4 and t5 must recognise both.",
